{"id":"tegami-mqt57snr","createdAt":"2026-06-25T06:50:31.767Z","version":"0.0.0","changelogs":{"backend-import-conditions.md":{"filename":"backend-import-conditions.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  npm:takumi-js:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Resolve the render backend through import conditions\n\nA `#backend` import map now selects napi on Node/Bun and WASM on workers, edge,\nand browsers at resolve time, replacing the runtime global sniffing and\n`@vite-ignore`d dynamic imports. Bundlers no longer drag the native\n`@takumi-rs/core` binary into worker/edge output, and `@takumi-rs/wasm` resolves\nunder pnpm's strict layout.\n"},"google-fonts-family-name.md":{"filename":"google-fonts-family-name.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  npm:@takumi-rs/helpers:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Rename the `googleFonts` family field from `family` to `name`\n\nA `GoogleFontFamily` object now spells its family as `name`, not `family` —\n`googleFonts({ families: [{ name: \"Inter\", weight: [400, 700] }] })`. Reads\ncleaner next to `families` and matches the `name` field on rendered fonts. Bare\nstring families are unchanged.\n"},"core-loader-dirname-shim.md":{"filename":"core-loader-dirname-shim.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  npm:@takumi-rs/core:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Strip the unused `__dirname` shim from the generated loader\n\nNAPI-RS emits a `new URL(\".\", import.meta.url)` `__dirname` shim the loader never\nreads. webpack and Turbopack treat it as an asset reference and fail the build\nwhen the addon is bundled for a Node runtime (such as a Next.js node-runtime\nroute). The loader patch now drops it.\n"},"wasm-auto-edge-light.md":{"filename":"wasm-auto-edge-light.md","content":"---\npackages:\n  npm:@takumi-rs/wasm:\n    type: patch\n---\n\n### Resolve `edge-light` in the `/auto` export\n\n`@takumi-rs/wasm/auto` now maps the `edge-light` condition (Next.js / Vercel\nEdge) to the `?module` loader, so edge bundlers get the binary form they need\ninstead of falling through to the Vite `?url` loader.\n"}},"packages":{"npm:@takumi-rs/image-response":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/helpers":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["google-fonts-family-name.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/wasm":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["wasm-auto-edge-light.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:@takumi-rs/core":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["core-loader-dirname-shim.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"npm:takumi-js":{"type":"patch","changelogIds":["backend-import-conditions.md"],"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"npm":{"distTag":"beta"},"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-raster":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-css":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-svg":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi-core":{"bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs"],"publish":true},"cargo:takumi":{"type":"patch","bumpReasons":["align with script-level configs","sync \"takumi\" group package versions"],"publish":true},"cargo:example":{"publish":false}}}